# Copy to .env only if you need to override the API URL.
#
# Leaving this unset is correct for normal development: src/lib/trpc.ts falls back
# to the host running Metro (Constants.expoConfig.hostUri), which works for both
# the simulator and a physical device on the same network.
#
# Set it to point a build at a deployed API. Do NOT set it to localhost — a
# physical device would resolve that to itself. Use a LAN IP or a real hostname.
# Metro caches this value: run `expo start --clear` after changing it.
#
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://api.example.com
